  "answer_text": "You can access the login portals for **PreLicenseTraining.com** through the official website:\n\n### 1. Student Login\nIf you are an insurance student completing your pre-licensing or continuing education (CE) courses:\n* **Access the Portal:** Go to the [PreLicenseTraining Homepage](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/) and click on the **Login** link at the top of the page. \n* **Credentials:** \n  * **Login Name:** By default, this is the **email address** you registered with (unless you manually changed it in your account settings).\n  * **Password:** Enter the password you created during sign-up.\n\n### 2. Mentor & Recruiter Login\nIf you are a manager, recruiter, or company administrator tracking your students' progress:\n* **Access the Portal:** You can reach the separate login portal via the [PreLicenseTraining Mentor Portal](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/) under the **Mentor Login** link located on the homepage or navigation bar.\n\n### Troubleshooting & Password Recovery\n* **Forgot Password:** If you cannot remember your password, use the **\"Forgot Password?\"** link on the login page. You will need access to your registered email to receive a password reset link.\n* **Forgot Login Name:** If you cannot remember your login name, use the **\"Forgot Login?\"** link. You can recover your username by entering either your email and password, or your first and last name along with your password.",
